WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.295
- [Evan] "When your
values are clear to you,

00:00:18.295 --> 00:00:20.694
"making decisions becomes easier."

00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:21.861
Roy E. Disney.

00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:25.922
Making decisions can be hard

00:00:25.922 --> 00:00:28.282
when you don't know what you stand for.

00:00:28.282 --> 00:00:29.797
Your one word is your core.

00:00:29.797 --> 00:00:30.929
It's your guided light.

00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:33.363
It makes all decisions easier.

00:00:33.363 --> 00:00:34.856
If you don't have that guiding light,

00:00:34.856 --> 00:00:36.374
then you never completely feel

00:00:36.374 --> 00:00:38.821
like you're going in the right direction.

00:00:38.821 --> 00:00:40.733
You'll constantly second guess yourself,

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:43.537
not being sure if you
made the best choice.

00:00:43.537 --> 00:00:46.505
You'll spend more time agonizing
over decisions and acts

00:00:46.505 --> 00:00:49.025
than making the decision
to improve your life

00:00:49.025 --> 00:00:50.602
and the life of others.

00:00:50.602 --> 00:00:52.134
When you know your one word,

00:00:52.134 --> 00:00:54.520
you can make decisions
that support your path.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.427
Decisions that were difficult before

00:00:56.427 --> 00:00:57.931
now become easy to make.

00:00:57.931 --> 00:01:00.126
You know if you should
start that business or not.

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.296
You know if you should
move to that city or not.

00:01:02.296 --> 00:01:04.952
You know if you should
marry that person or not.

00:01:04.952 --> 00:01:06.737
It's also easy for people to understand

00:01:06.737 --> 00:01:10.027
who you are and how they can help you.

00:01:10.027 --> 00:01:11.770
Everything becomes easier,

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.738
your life, your business.

00:01:13.738 --> 00:01:16.321
Everything becomes much easier.

